\* All TLC check configs for AntflyMlGraphPasses.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflyMlGraphPasses.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDanglingCse = FALSE
    BuggyParameterDedup = FALSE
    BuggyMissingLowerClosure = FALSE
    BuggyFallbackRuntime = FALSE
    BuggyPartialPublish = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    CurrentGraphReferencesValid
    ExportedGraphReferencesValid
    OutputNodePreserved
    PassOrderRespected
    ParameterAndConstantIdentityPreserved
    FailedPassOutputNotVisible
    ExternalPartitionInputsMaterialized
    RuntimeGateFailsClosed
    Safety

==== BadDanglingCse
\* Expected-failure config: CSE removes a duplicate producer without remapping
\* consumers, leaving a dangling input reference.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDanglingCse = TRUE
    BuggyParameterDedup = FALSE
    BuggyMissingLowerClosure = FALSE
    BuggyFallbackRuntime = FALSE
    BuggyPartialPublish = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    CurrentGraphReferencesValid

==== BadFallbackRuntime
\* Expected-failure config: graph runtime publishes a native executor even
\* though the partition summary contains a fallback partition and the gate is
\* configured to fail closed.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDanglingCse = FALSE
    BuggyParameterDedup = FALSE
    BuggyMissingLowerClosure = FALSE
    BuggyFallbackRuntime = TRUE
    BuggyPartialPublish = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    RuntimeGateFailsClosed

==== BadMissingLowerClosure
\* Expected-failure config: partition export publishes a fused node while
\* omitting its primitive vjp/lowering closure.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDanglingCse = FALSE
    BuggyParameterDedup = FALSE
    BuggyMissingLowerClosure = TRUE
    BuggyFallbackRuntime = FALSE
    BuggyPartialPublish = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    ExportedGraphReferencesValid

==== BadParameterDedup
\* Expected-failure config: CSE incorrectly collapses parameter/constant
\* identity while still leaving a structurally valid graph.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDanglingCse = FALSE
    BuggyParameterDedup = TRUE
    BuggyMissingLowerClosure = FALSE
    BuggyFallbackRuntime = FALSE
    BuggyPartialPublish = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    ParameterAndConstantIdentityPreserved

==== BadPartialPublish
\* Expected-failure config: a failed pass leaves partial output visible to
\* later pipeline/export steps.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDanglingCse = FALSE
    BuggyParameterDedup = FALSE
    BuggyMissingLowerClosure = FALSE
    BuggyFallbackRuntime = FALSE
    BuggyPartialPublish = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    FailedPassOutputNotVisible
